     Note: the usual random-split inflation does NOT appear here, and the
     reason is worth stating. That inflation comes from subject identity
     carrying label information. Every subject here is ~50/50 left/right,
     so knowing WHO a trial came from says nothing about WHICH HAND, and
     leaking subject identity buys the model nothing. The dangerous leak in
